1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 2=

3
00:00:13,894 --> 00:00:16,455
(Prosperity)
Prosperity, Luosen's premier nightclub,

4
00:00:16,495 --> 00:00:18,254
took a sharp downturn after its owner,

5
00:00:18,254 --> 00:00:20,055
Tu Jiasheng, was arrested.

6
00:00:20,055 --> 00:00:22,295
Top hostesses left one after another.

7
00:00:22,295 --> 00:00:24,015
The membership cancellation crisis
keeps flaring up.

8
00:00:24,174 --> 00:00:25,215
Once a playground for the wealthy,

9
00:00:25,215 --> 00:00:26,614
its glory has completely faded.

10
00:00:27,007 --> 00:00:28,632
(Su Yunian)

11
00:00:30,032 --> 00:00:31,881
(Bai Ruxue)
Fewer guests have been coming lately.

12
00:00:31,881 --> 00:00:32,885
That's right.

13
00:00:34,454 --> 00:00:35,454
What are you two doing?

14
00:00:35,614 --> 00:00:36,815
And you three,

15
00:00:36,975 --> 00:00:37,994
what are you standing around for?

16
00:00:37,994 --> 00:00:40,134
No tables in any VIP room
are to be left bare today.

17
00:00:40,175 --> 00:00:41,454
We have fewer guests,

18
00:00:42,015 --> 00:00:43,895
but we can't let
Prosperity prestige slip.

19
00:00:44,214 --> 00:00:45,454
Look at her acting all high and mighty.

20
00:00:45,814 --> 00:00:47,695
She stepped on Jiasheng,

21
00:00:47,734 --> 00:00:48,774
climbed up through Feng,

22
00:00:49,094 --> 00:00:50,174
copied Lu,

23
00:00:50,255 --> 00:00:52,094
and even wore Manni's clothes

24
00:00:52,094 --> 00:00:54,094
just to crawl up to where she is now.

25
00:00:56,655 --> 00:00:57,655
Vice President Bai,

26
00:00:57,774 --> 00:00:59,295
I know you look down on me.

27
00:00:59,295 --> 00:01:00,494
But Prosperity

28
00:01:00,615 --> 00:01:01,774
is open for business.

29
00:01:02,295 --> 00:01:03,854
Since guests have come,

30
00:01:04,214 --> 00:01:06,134
shouldn't we treat them
with proper hospitality?

31
00:01:07,494 --> 00:01:08,774
Well said, Ms. Su.

32
00:01:09,615 --> 00:01:10,854
I just wonder,

33
00:01:10,935 --> 00:01:13,134
with Prosperity under your management,

34
00:01:13,494 --> 00:01:16,055
will any guests
still be willing to come?

35
00:01:20,615 --> 00:01:21,815
Get back to work, everyone.

36
00:01:39,895 --> 00:01:40,895
How did it go?

37
00:01:41,335 --> 00:01:42,695
(Bai Manni)
Did you send Jiasheng away?

38
00:01:45,335 --> 00:01:46,335
He refused to go.

39
00:01:53,455 --> 00:01:54,455
Here,

40
00:01:54,934 --> 00:01:55,934
eat something first.

41
00:02:01,815 --> 00:02:02,815
Manni,

42
00:02:03,535 --> 00:02:04,695
Jiasheng is hiding something.

43
00:02:05,374 --> 00:02:06,975
He knew this was a setup all along.

44
00:02:07,374 --> 00:02:09,414
He chose to go
to Sea Breeze Prison on purpose.

45
00:02:15,815 --> 00:02:17,094
No matter what he is planning,

46
00:02:17,694 --> 00:02:19,335
since he trusted us with the club,

47
00:02:19,814 --> 00:02:20,855
we have to hold the fort.

48
00:02:22,175 --> 00:02:23,175
By the way,

49
00:02:23,575 --> 00:02:25,415
there are still some documents
in Room 999.

50
00:02:26,214 --> 00:02:27,374
Should we get rid of them?

51
00:02:27,814 --> 00:02:29,055
Not all of them.

52
00:02:29,335 --> 00:02:30,335
Leave it to me.

53
00:02:30,774 --> 00:02:32,295
It's nothing but mixing truth with lies

54
00:02:32,855 --> 00:02:33,934
to keep them guessing.

55
00:02:40,227 --> 00:02:41,227
(Prosperity)

56
00:02:55,254 --> 00:02:57,455
(Huang Weide)
Tu Jiasheng, you're quite full of yourself.

57
00:02:57,895 --> 00:02:59,615
(Huang Weipin)
You didn't even come out to greet me!

58
00:03:00,934 --> 00:03:01,974
What did you do?

59
00:03:03,135 --> 00:03:04,735
Think you're tough now?

60
00:03:05,374 --> 00:03:06,534
Dare play me?

61
00:03:06,534 --> 00:03:07,615
Darn you!

62
00:03:07,615 --> 00:03:09,534
- Tu Jiasheng!
- Bring it on!

63
00:03:10,895 --> 00:03:12,415
Tu Jiasheng!

64
00:03:19,015 --> 00:03:21,814
- Get him!
- Get him!

65
00:03:22,015 --> 00:03:24,814
- Get him!
- Get him!

66
00:03:56,135 --> 00:03:57,135
Boss Huang,

67
00:03:58,254 --> 00:03:59,254
let's talk.

68
00:04:03,254 --> 00:04:04,254
Sure.

69
00:04:15,335 --> 00:04:16,415
Why make such a scene

70
00:04:16,415 --> 00:04:17,654
on your first visit to Prosperity?

71
00:04:18,814 --> 00:04:20,534
Did we fail to treat you properly?

72
00:04:21,974 --> 00:04:23,494
No, you didn't.

73
00:04:24,455 --> 00:04:25,775
But since you know who I am,

74
00:04:26,574 --> 00:04:28,855
did you really have to
kill my brother here

75
00:04:29,175 --> 00:04:30,775
over a girl named An Ruoxi?

76
00:04:30,775 --> 00:04:31,775
For this,

77
00:04:31,814 --> 00:04:32,934
you owe me an explanation.

78
00:04:35,894 --> 00:04:36,894
Then today,

79
00:04:37,894 --> 00:04:39,615
what kind of explanation do you want?

80
00:04:40,055 --> 00:04:41,055
Simple.

81
00:04:41,535 --> 00:04:43,374
An Ruoxi's sister, Su Yunian,

82
00:04:44,175 --> 00:04:46,095
is right here.

83
00:04:46,775 --> 00:04:47,855
Let her leave with me

84
00:04:47,934 --> 00:04:49,014
and serve me for a few days.

85
00:04:49,855 --> 00:04:51,415
Then we'll call it even.

86
00:05:01,215 --> 00:05:02,934
I thought you were going
to ask for something big.

87
00:05:03,175 --> 00:05:05,095
- Just that?
- Just that.

88
00:05:08,095 --> 00:05:09,095
Then it's a deal.

89
00:05:12,295 --> 00:05:13,295
Deal.

90
00:05:20,814 --> 00:05:21,814
Pretty boy.

91
00:05:22,334 --> 00:05:23,374
Soft and fair skin.

92
00:05:24,134 --> 00:05:25,134
The new guy,

93
00:05:25,134 --> 00:05:26,535
let me spoil you tonight.

94
00:05:28,014 --> 00:05:29,055
A guy like this

95
00:05:30,014 --> 00:05:32,175
must be some rich woman's boy toy.

96
00:05:33,215 --> 00:05:34,215
You know?

97
00:05:34,494 --> 00:05:36,014
He is Tu Jiasheng,

98
00:05:36,334 --> 00:05:39,254
the boss of Prosperity.

99
00:05:41,454 --> 00:05:42,454
Watch out, Feng.

100
00:05:42,494 --> 00:05:43,494
The floor is slippery.

101
00:05:45,735 --> 00:05:46,735
Great.

102
00:05:47,655 --> 00:05:49,134
Nicely wrecked.

103
00:05:50,694 --> 00:05:53,655
I always thought the decor here
looked outdated.

104
00:05:54,254 --> 00:05:55,295
Now it's taken care of.

105
00:05:56,175 --> 00:05:58,775
The Yanyue Gang tore it down for me.

106
00:06:01,415 --> 00:06:02,934
From now on,

107
00:06:03,454 --> 00:06:05,694
let Ruxue run Prosperity.

108
00:06:10,254 --> 00:06:11,494
Thank you, Feng.

109
00:06:13,855 --> 00:06:14,855
Lu,

110
00:06:15,694 --> 00:06:16,694
any objections?

111
00:06:34,254 --> 00:06:35,374
Whatever you say, Feng.

112
00:06:36,694 --> 00:06:38,014
You always know what's best.

113
00:06:40,134 --> 00:06:41,134
Come on.

114
00:06:41,415 --> 00:06:42,655
Show me around inside.

115
00:06:55,134 --> 00:06:56,134
Feng,

116
00:06:56,655 --> 00:06:58,295
since I'm not needed at Prosperity,

117
00:06:58,775 --> 00:06:59,855
how about giving me some time off

118
00:07:00,134 --> 00:07:01,134
so I can take a trip?

119
00:07:02,254 --> 00:07:03,615
Where to, Lu?

120
00:07:04,535 --> 00:07:05,535
Sea Breeze Prison?

121
00:07:06,095 --> 00:07:07,494
To stay close to Jiasheng?

122
00:07:09,095 --> 00:07:10,095
Of course not.

123
00:07:10,574 --> 00:07:12,014
Everyone knows Sea Breeze is your turf.

124
00:07:12,175 --> 00:07:13,175
Why would I bother?

125
00:07:15,134 --> 00:07:16,334
If you didn't care,

126
00:07:16,574 --> 00:07:18,655
you wouldn't have chased him
on your motorcycle.

127
00:07:25,374 --> 00:07:26,374
Lu,

128
00:07:27,014 --> 00:07:29,694
the Cabinet is looking into
your father's case.

129
00:07:29,934 --> 00:07:33,574
I've been working really hard on this.

130
00:07:34,055 --> 00:07:35,175
Don't worry, though.

131
00:07:35,975 --> 00:07:38,175
I'll do everything I can to help.

132
00:07:58,574 --> 00:08:00,934
Tu Jiasheng, Mr. Tu, right?

133
00:08:01,334 --> 00:08:02,574
Our boss wants to see you.

134
00:08:08,374 --> 00:08:09,535
Jiasheng's Room 999.

135
00:08:15,775 --> 00:08:16,814
Won't you look inside?

136
00:08:17,775 --> 00:08:18,775
Sure.

137
00:08:27,454 --> 00:08:28,454
On second thought, no.

138
00:08:28,894 --> 00:08:31,694
The stench of Jiasheng in there
is too strong.

139
00:08:32,494 --> 00:08:33,494
Lu,

140
00:08:33,574 --> 00:08:34,775
change it

141
00:08:35,134 --> 00:08:36,494
to a scent I like.

142
00:08:37,295 --> 00:08:38,934
Got it. Got it.

143
00:08:43,094 --> 00:08:44,094
Lu,

144
00:08:45,334 --> 00:08:47,015
no need to worry about Jiasheng.

145
00:08:47,734 --> 00:08:49,495
He won't be lonely at Sea Breeze.

146
00:08:50,015 --> 00:08:51,775
I arranged for some old friends

147
00:08:52,295 --> 00:08:53,295
to take care of him.

148
00:09:06,775 --> 00:09:07,775
Jiasheng.

149
00:09:07,775 --> 00:09:08,775
Mr. Tu.

150
00:09:09,744 --> 00:09:10,775
Welcome.

151
00:09:10,775 --> 00:09:12,934
I wondered who was so eager to see me.

152
00:09:13,614 --> 00:09:15,015
Turns out it's Chief Phachai.

153
00:09:16,255 --> 00:09:17,255
(Tu Jiasheng)

154
00:09:17,694 --> 00:09:19,295
Kneel down
and call me grandpa right now,

155
00:09:19,495 --> 00:09:21,175
and I might just spare your lives.

156
00:09:23,028 --> 00:09:24,694
Darn it, none of you get out alive!

157
00:09:30,574 --> 00:09:31,574
After all these years,

158
00:09:32,094 --> 00:09:33,334
I thought I'd never

159
00:09:33,614 --> 00:09:35,094
see you again in this lifetime.

160
00:09:35,614 --> 00:09:37,614
Never expected we'd reunite here.

161
00:09:38,535 --> 00:09:40,255
Heaven is just.

162
00:09:41,214 --> 00:09:43,015
Remember how
you leaned on the Grand Princess

163
00:09:43,015 --> 00:09:45,055
and locked me up here?

164
00:09:45,055 --> 00:09:46,055
Remember

165
00:09:46,334 --> 00:09:48,655
how you were humiliated

166
00:09:48,895 --> 00:09:50,094
at our door?

167
00:09:51,295 --> 00:09:52,934
You don't deserve such a good life.

168
00:09:53,454 --> 00:09:54,655
Always the haughty Mr. Tu.

169
00:09:55,694 --> 00:09:57,094
Even after ending up in Sea Breeze,

170
00:09:57,094 --> 00:09:58,495
you still act tough.

171
00:09:59,255 --> 00:10:00,255
Boys,

172
00:10:01,094 --> 00:10:02,895
take good care of my old friend.

173
00:10:23,359 --> 00:10:26,975
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

174
00:10:27,345 --> 00:10:31,330
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

175
00:10:36,086 --> 00:10:39,405
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

176
00:10:39,405 --> 00:10:44,490
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

177
00:10:48,079 --> 00:10:54,631
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

178
00:10:54,631 --> 00:11:03,052
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

179
00:11:03,052 --> 00:11:06,281
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

180
00:11:06,281 --> 00:11:09,476
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

181
00:11:09,476 --> 00:11:12,169
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

182
00:11:12,169 --> 00:11:16,786
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

183
00:11:20,697 --> 00:11:23,186
♪Burning alone♪

184
00:11:28,692 --> 00:11:35,061
♪The glory fades♪
